          "type": "void*"
        },
        {
          "name": "H 128 2",
          "type": "void*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Int",
      "docs": "!\nXXH128_cmp():\nThis comparator is compatible with stdlib's `qsort()`/`bsearch()`.\nreturn: >0 if *h128_1  > *h128_2\n<0 if *h128_1  < *h128_2\n=0 if *h128_1 == *h128_2"
